'''Bannerman Doge''' (足軽わんこ, ''Ashigaru Wanko'', '''Footsoldier Doge''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] variant of [[Doge]] introduced in 12th Anniversary stages. It was added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Bannerman Doge
|image = E 702.png
|first appearance = [[Satsuma Imo Domain]]
|money drop = 15¢ - 59¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is a Doge wearing a [[wikipedia:Kasa (hat)|Kasa]], holding a spear and a black banner with a paw symbol on it. Its stats are identical to Doge's.

==Strategy==
Treat this enemy like a regular Doge.

